# inc-6w5x: minimal session for INCURSION_RANGED_ILLUSION_PROBE
# (RangedIllusionProbe, src/RangedIllusionProbe.cpp). The probe runs once at the
# start of Game::Play(), so this script only needs a way into a live map and a
# clean exit. Read by tools/check_ranged_illusion.sh.

@include chargen.keys

SPACE*80
ESC*20

@quit
